  "steps": [
    "Preheat oven to 300°F. Pat roast dry, season generously.",
    "Sear roast in hot oil 5 min per side. Remove.",
    "Melt butter, cook onions 25-30 min until golden.",
    "Add garlic 2 min, deglaze with wine, reduce by half. Add flour.",
    "Add broth, Worcestershire, bay leaves, rosemary, thyme. Bring to simmer.",
    "Return roast. Cover and braise in oven 3 1/2 hours until tender.",
    "Increase oven to 400°F. Shred beef. Top with Gruyere, bake 5-7 min until melted.",
    "Serve over mashed potatoes or with toasted baguette."
